*cache*
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.egg-info/
*.egg

# porting scratch: run transcripts, pip logs, and scene-file backups
run_log*.txt
pip_*log.txt
*.bak
.vscode/
videos/

# tools/propose_keypoints.py output: one directory per run, regenerable for free
keypoint_proposals/

# vlm_query/ is deliberately NOT ignored, but it is not a dumping ground either: each query
# directory carries a ~208 KB query_img.png, so add one only when the run is worth keeping --
# a paid response whose content some conclusion rests on, or a constraint set something was
# actually executed against. Plumbing rehearsals that nothing cites can be deleted instead.
# (Copies of one proposal image cost nothing extra, since git stores blobs by content; a *new*
# Phase 1 proposal is what adds another 208 KB.)
